   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Absalon."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 20.4,
   "end": 23.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Alright, Freeza's just over this next formation."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 23.2,
   "end": 25.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Now before we move in, we need a plan."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 25.46,
   "end": 26.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "So here it is:"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 26.72,
   "end": 30.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "All of you will attack from the front, and while you're being slaughtered,"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 30.12,
   "end": 33.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I'll flank him, taking him from behind and securing the kill!"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 33.44,
   "end": 34.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Ready? Break!"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 34.52,
   "end": 35.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 35.02,
   "end": 35.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Yeah, no."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 35.9,
   "end": 39.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "Personally, I don't think Bulma should be here; a battlefield is no place for a lady."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 39.76,
   "end": 41.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "And yet, you're sticking around."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 41.38,
   "end": 43.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "I'm serious! I worry about her safety!"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 43.86,
   "end": 46.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "And as my close, personal friend, possibly even bestie,"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 46.96,
   "end": 48.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "I think we need to consider--"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 48.2,
   "end": 48.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "AAagh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 48.7,
   "end": 52.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Anyone want to explain to Yamcha here what ten pounds of torque does to a human ear?"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 53.1,
   "end": 53.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Rips it off?"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 53.88,
   "end": 55.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Very good, Gohan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 56.08,
   "end": 60.72,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Laughing"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 60.72,
   "end": 61.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Ahh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 70.203,
   "end": 73.623,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "So is this him, sweetie? Is this the man who hurt you so?"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 73.803,
   "end": 74.843,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "No, Daddy."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 75.303,
   "end": 77.303,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "This is a new one..."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 77.303,
   "end": 79.623,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "So... you must be Friza."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 79.943,
   "end": 82.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Actually, it's Lord Freeza."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 82.463,
   "end": 84.803,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Really? Then why is there an \"i\" in it?"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 84.883,
   "end": 86.183,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "There *isn't*."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 86.263,
   "end": 88.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Huh. Gonna have to fix that one when I get back, then."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 88.603,
   "end": 90.803,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Anyway, I'm here to kill you."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 90.803,
   "end": 97.483,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Ohohohohohoho, my my! Not five minutes on this wayward rock and we already have a volunteer-teer-teer--"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 97.483,
   "end": 97.983,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 97.983,
   "end": 98.863,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "dead man."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 99.043,
   "end": 101.043,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Soldiers! Do your jobs!"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 101.043,
   "end": 102.763,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Straw",
   "text": "Lord Freeza, with all due respect--"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 102.763,
   "end": 104.323,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "This sounds like insubordination."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 104.323,
   "end": 107.723,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Straw",
   "text": "He just turned an entire squad into a pile of limbs!"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 107.723,
   "end": 110.523,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "And that sounds like it's not my problem!"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 110.523,
   "end": 112.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chayote",
   "text": "Man, moving your bitchin' bitch-ass over, bitch."
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 113.163,
   "end": 114.743,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Rapid Scouter beeping"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 114.743,
   "end": 116.243,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chayote",
   "text": "What, power level of five?"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 116.463,
   "end": 118.163,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chayote",
   "text": "Shit, ain't nobody got time for dat!"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 121.383,
   "end": 122.443,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chayote",
   "text": "...Well, that ain't right..."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 125.523,
   "end": 128.803,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Consider that a warning! Either leave now, or die!"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 128.803,
   "end": 132.523,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Ooh, is that an ultimatum?! I love ultimatums!"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 132.663,
   "end": 133.363,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Here's mine:"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 133.663,
   "end": 135.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Either die to him or die to me!"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 147.783,
   "end": 149.783,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What... what just happened?"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 149.783,
   "end": 150.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Give it a second."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 150.603,
   "end": 151.823,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "No, really, they're just--"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 151.823,
   "end": 152.863,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "No, no, hold on!"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 158.663,
   "end": 163.143,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Yeah, took me a whole three months to get that one down. They make it look a lot easier than it really is."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 163.143,
   "end": 164.963,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Real hard part was that guy's armor!"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 166.483,
   "end": 169.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I ended up going through a dozen mannequins before I cinched that one."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 170.343,
   "end": 171.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You missed a spot."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 171.763,
   "end": 172.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Minion",
   "text": "Augghhhh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 174.283,
   "end": 175.663,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Minion",
   "text": "Lord Freeza..."
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 176.283,
   "end": 177.503,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Minion",
   "text": "...the f*ck?"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 180.403,
   "end": 182.683,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "You know that was our last minion, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 182.683,
   "end": 184.863,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Who cares? We have more at home."
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 184.863,
   "end": 187.463,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "No, I mean now we have no one to fly the ship!"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 187.463,
   "end": 188.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I can fly it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 188.563,
   "end": 191.823,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Son, we do not fly ourselves; flying is for the help!"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 191.823,
   "end": 196.143,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "So, uh... curious; what's with all the spare parts sticking out of you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 196.143,
   "end": 197.423,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Impudent little...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 197.423,
   "end": 199.543,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "These are not \"spare parts\"!"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 199.763,
   "end": 203.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What you are looking at is the ultimate culmination of science and nature!"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 203.603,
   "end": 207.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Oh, wow! I've... never seen that before..."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 208.283,
   "end": 214.503,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You know, the only reason you continue to breathe is because I need something to entertain me until the Super Saiyan arrives."
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 214.603,
   "end": 215.483,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Oh, really?"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 215.843,
   "end": 220.023,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Because if it's a Super Saiyan you're looking for... I can fill the part."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 220.023,
   "end": 220.823,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 222.763,
   "end": 225.463,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "(Laughing)"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 225.463,
   "end": 227.543,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh, you hear that, Daddy?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 227.543,
   "end": 228.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "\"I can fill the part!\""
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 229.043,
   "end": 231.863,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "It's like a five year old trying to play police officer."
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 232.003,
   "end": 234.323,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Or like how you play Pretty Pink Princess?"
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 234.323,
   "end": 236.543,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"BP∞ Battle Point Unlimited\" fades in ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 234.323,
   "end": 236.543,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Daddy, not in front of the malcontent!"
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 236.543,
   "end": 238.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "But it's so *cute* when you do it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 238.603,
   "end": 241.943,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I haven't done that since I was eight-eight-ei-eight--"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 241.443,
   "end": 241.943,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 241.943,
   "end": 243.143,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "my Quinceañera."
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 243.143,
   "end": 244.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "HAAAAAAA!"
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 244.563,
   "end": 245.123,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 244.563,
   "end": 245.123,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "AAAAAAAA!"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 245.123,
   "end": 245.963,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Zounds!"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 245.123,
   "end": 250.843,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "AAAAAAAA!!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 251.023,
   "end": 251.743,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"BP∞ Battle Point Unlimited\" fades out ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 251.023,
   "end": 251.743,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "(Gasp)"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 251.023,
   "end": 251.743,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "(Gasp)"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 252.083,
   "end": 253.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "That's... that's my Dad!"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 254.163,
   "end": 255.163,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "You sure, Gohan?"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 255.223,
   "end": 257.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Either that or we just felt Freeza's mom."
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 257.883,
   "end": 260.023,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Who here just thought of Freeza with boobs?"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 260.943,
   "end": 261.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "...Really?"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 261.783,
   "end": 263.123,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "I'm the only one?"
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 263.123,
   "end": 263.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Yes!"
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 264.183,
   "end": 265.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'He must never know...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 273.763,
   "end": 275.383,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Those... those eyes...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 275.723,
   "end": 276.763,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "They're the same as...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 277.183,
   "end": 279.103,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Flashback Goku",
   "text": "'Pizza...!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 279.103,
   "end": 291.383,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "No...! No! NO! NO! *NO*! KILL! MURDER! DESTROY! EXTERMINATE! EXTERMINATE!"
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 285.483,
   "end": 286.103,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 286.683,
   "end": 287.183,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 287.763,
   "end": 288.263,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 295.603,
   "end": 299.043,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Uh-hu, u-ha-ha, a-ha-ha, ha-ha-ha-ha-ha...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 299.203,
   "end": 304.683,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Alright, get down here; I'm going to call Space Triple A and have them tow us, thank you very much!"
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 304.903,
   "end": 305.443,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "What?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 305.683,
   "end": 306.303,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "*What*?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 306.383,
   "end": 310.043,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ The Lion King's \"Circle of Life\" ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 310.043,
   "end": 311.383,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Freeza, what did you do?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 311.383,
   "end": 312.623,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "DADDY, NOT NOW!"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 317.783,
   "end": 320.143,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Grrrrh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 320.143,
   "end": 323.043,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Well, Freeza, looks like you *dropped the ball*."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 325.043,
   "end": 326.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "*Dropped the ball*."
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 329.483,
   "end": 331.203,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "...Drrrrropped the ba--"
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 331.203,
   "end": 331.703,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "AAAGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 334.843,
   "end": 336.503,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Screaming and yelling"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 342.503,
   "end": 344.823,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "You almost destroyed the whole planet there."
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 344.963,
   "end": 348.943,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Sorry - I got a little bit carried away. Doesn't matter now, though;"
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 348.943,
   "end": 351.943,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"BP∞ Battle Point Unlimited\" fades in ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 348.943,
   "end": 352.443,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "our little Super Saiyan is dead-dead-dead--"
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 351.943,
   "end": 352.443,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BZZZT"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 352.443,
   "end": 353.663,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "cadaverific."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 356.563,
   "end": 357.883,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Hey, Freeza!"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 357.883,
   "end": 358.783,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "*WHAT*?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 358.783,
   "end": 360.083,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "You should split!"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 362.183,
   "end": 364.083,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "If you're trying to be clever, you're sorely lacking--"
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 364.08,
   "end": 367.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Hiiiyaaaaaaaaahhhh-!"
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 365.06,
   "end": 365.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Huh?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 367.403,
   "end": 369.063,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Aaaaaaaaahhhhh-!"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 369.063,
   "end": 370.723,
   "kind": "dialog",
