   "text": "-Aaaahhhh-!"
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 376.483,
   "end": 376.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "-Aaaahhhh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 376.98,
   "end": 378.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "-HI-YAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 378.063,
   "end": 379.283,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"BP∞ Battle Point Unlimited\" pauses ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 378.063,
   "end": 382.663,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "(Computer-like yelling)"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 382.663,
   "end": 383.523,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Windows error sound"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 384.123,
   "end": 385.403,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"BP∞ Battle Point Unlimited\" resumes ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 384.123,
   "end": 387.203,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Many Windows error sounds"
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 388.423,
   "end": 391.323,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "*My baby boy*...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 391.323,
   "end": 392.503,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "We're finally here!"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 392.783,
   "end": 393.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Where's Freeza-- Oh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 394.423,
   "end": 395.183,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "There he is!"
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 401.263,
   "end": 402.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "And there..."
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 403.043,
   "end": 404.023,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "And there--"
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 404.023,
   "end": 404.823,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "♫ \"BP∞ Battle Point Unlimited\" cuts-off ♫"
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 404.823,
   "end": 405.783,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "And here..."
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 406.463,
   "end": 407.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Is that his brain...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 409.783,
   "end": 413.683,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Guys... I think that person is a Super Saiyan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 413.683,
   "end": 415.023,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Like hell he is!"
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 415.023,
   "end": 416.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Spiky gold hair? Incredible power?"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 416.903,
   "end": 421.083,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "You don't know that he's a Super Saiyan! Maybe he's Super *Human*, huh?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 421.083,
   "end": 423.643,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Maybe you slackers just haven't been trying hard enough!"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 423.743,
   "end": 425.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Says the *non*-Super Saiyan."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 425.583,
   "end": 426.223,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "F*ck off!"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 431.963,
   "end": 435.163,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "You murdered my Princess!"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 437.583,
   "end": 439.183,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Oh well - you win some, you lose some."
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 439.543,
   "end": 440.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "...Children?"
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 440.563,
   "end": 441.083,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 441.383,
   "end": 444.703,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Okay... sorta thought you'd be a little more pissed."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 444.703,
   "end": 447.163,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Oh, blindingly so. Mind if I see your sword?"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 447.163,
   "end": 448.463,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "What? Why?"
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 448.463,
   "end": 450.023,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "I just wish to hold it."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 450.023,
   "end": 450.683,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "No!"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 450.683,
   "end": 452.663,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Oh, come on, be neighborly!"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 452.663,
   "end": 453.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I'm not your neighbor."
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 454.183,
   "end": 455.523,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I also think I hate you."
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 455.523,
   "end": 458.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Look, after what you did, I can fit what's left of my son into a meat pie!"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 458.983,
   "end": 460.723,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Let me see your stupid sword!"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 463.843,
   "end": 464.963,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "(Sigh) Fine..."
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 466.443,
   "end": 470.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "See? Nothing nefarious; I just wanted to inspect the craftsmanship..."
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 471.863,
   "end": 473.483,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Admire the temper..."
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 473.983,
   "end": 476.623,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Test its edge on YOU, YOU INSUBORDINATE HICK!"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 479.163,
   "end": 481.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Ah... Still not sure if you hate me...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 481.923,
   "end": 483.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Actually, that pretty much sealed it."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 484.083,
   "end": 485.363,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "AAAGHaaaagh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 488.423,
   "end": 492.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "(Gasp) No...! N-no, wait, please I...! W-We can make a deal!"
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 492.683,
   "end": 495.443,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "If you spare my life I'll... give you a planet...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 495.943,
   "end": 496.823,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "*Three* planets!"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 497.603,
   "end": 498.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "Two and a half?"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 498.403,
   "end": 499.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "You just went down."
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 500.083,
   "end": 501.263,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "I'm a haggler...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 501.803,
   "end": 502.543,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "King Cold",
   "text": "WEEEGHH...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 511.063,
   "end": 512.043,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "...Good work, team!"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 519.403,
   "end": 520.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Hey there, guys!"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 520.603,
   "end": 521.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "F*ck this guy!"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 521.703,
   "end": 524.463,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I'm about to go meet Goku; just follow me!"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 524.663,
   "end": 526.723,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Wait... did he just say my Dad?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 526.723,
   "end": 527.543,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Wait, Gohan..."
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 527.783,
   "end": 529.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "We don't know if we can trust this guy..."
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 529.903,
   "end": 531.523,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I also brought snacks!"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "start": 531.683,
   "end": 534.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "But, the Bible does say, \"love thy neighbor\"."
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "start": 534.923,
   "end": 535.943,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "You're a Buddhist."
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "start": 535.943,
   "end": 537.863,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "A *hungry* Buddhist!"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "start": 540.523,
   "end": 545.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "GPS",
   "text": "Fly three hundred meters northwest, then land near \"Idiot Rock\"."
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "start": 545.803,
   "end": 548.143,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "So that's what they called it before \"Idiot Crater\"."
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "start": 553.883,
   "end": 556.603,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Now, I'm sure you're all wondering why I brought you here."
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "start": 556.603,
   "end": 557.203,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Snacks!"
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "start": 557.203,
   "end": 557.903,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Yamcha",
   "text": "To kill us!"
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "start": 557.903,
   "end": 558.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "To kill snacks!"
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "start": 559.203,
   "end": 562.483,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Goku is going to land near here in approximately three hours."
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "start": 562.483,
   "end": 567.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Until then... Let's all have a drink."
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "start": 567.723,
   "end": 570.363,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I've got soda, beer, and Hetap."
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "start": 570.463,
   "end": 572.423,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Isn't it a little early to start drinking?"
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "start": 572.423,
   "end": 573.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Hey, five o'clock was twenty hours ago!"
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "start": 575.163,
   "end": 576.723,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "So, stranger, what's your name?"
  },
  {
   "i": 215,
   "start": 576.843,
   "end": 577.703,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Can't say."
  },
  {
   "i": 216,
   "start": 577.703,
   "end": 579.763,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Well, Mr. Can't Say, I'm Krillin!"
  },
  {
   "i": 217,
   "start": 579.763,
   "end": 580.743,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "That's not funny."
  },
  {
   "i": 218,
   "start": 580.883,
   "end": 581.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "What isn't?"
  },
  {
   "i": 219,
   "start": 581.863,
   "end": 584.643,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "So... you know my Dad, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 220,
   "start": 584.643,
   "end": 587.163,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Well, sort of. Really, I've just heard a lot about him."
  },
  {
   "i": 221,
   "start": 587.403,
   "end": 588.023,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "It's kind of--"
  },
  {
   "i": 222,
   "start": 588.023,
   "end": 591.183,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "So, hey like, just gonna throw this out there..."
  },
  {
   "i": 223,
   "start": 591.323,
   "end": 592.743,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "You're really cute."
  },
  {
   "i": 224,
   "start": 592.743,
   "end": 595.823,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Uh... well, you know, my Mom always said I was a cute kid."
  },
  {
   "i": 225,
   "start": 595.823,
   "end": 597.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Oh, a mamma's boy, huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 226,
   "start": 598.263,
   "end": 599.503,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "I'll be your mommy..."
  },
  {
   "i": 227,
   "start": 599.503,
   "end": 602.003,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "'AAAAAAAAAAAAAA--'"
  },
  {
   "i": 228,
   "start": 602.003,
   "end": 603.063,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Can I have another Hetap?"
  },
  {
   "i": 229,
   "start": 603.063,
   "end": 604.683,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "YE-HES, YES YOU CAN."
  },
  {
   "i": 230,
   "start": 604.863,
   "end": 607.703,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "By the way, that jacket is awfully familiar..."
  },
  {
   "i": 231,
   "start": 607.703,
   "end": 608.783,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Uhm..."
  },
  {
   "i": 232,
   "start": 608.783,
   "end": 611.363,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Yeah - I even made it myself!"
  },
  {
   "i": 233,
   "start": 611.363,
   "end": 614.403,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Capsule Corp logo, even cut it short to show off my midriff."
  },
  {
   "i": 234,
   "start": 614.723,
   "end": 619.363,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'If he's never met him before, how the hell does this kid know where Kakarot is going to land?'"
  },
  {
   "i": 235,
   "start": 619.36,
   "end": 621.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "I love everything about Capsule Corp!"
  },
  {
   "i": 236,
   "start": 619.36,
   "end": 621.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'And he can't actually be a damn Saiyan...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 237,
   "start": 622.223,
   "end": 623.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'Either he's a liar, or...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 238,
   "start": 623.92,
   "end": 626.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Yep, love storing things..."
  },
  {
   "i": 239,
   "start": 623.92,
   "end": 626.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'...maybe...'"
  },
  {
   "i": 240,
   "start": 626.003,
   "end": 627.243,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "'...Wait a second...!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 241,
   "start": 627.243,
   "end": 630.263,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Did someone drink the last Hetap?! I'll kill you!"
  },
  {
   "i": 242,
   "start": 630.263,
   "end": 631.943,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Whoop whoop whoop whoop whoop whoop whoop whoop whoop!"
  },
  {
   "i": 243,
   "start": 641.163,
   "end": 644.783,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chiaotzu",
   "text": "Tieeenn~... I'm booooored..."
  },
  {
   "i": 244,
   "start": 644.783,
   "end": 647.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Chiaotzu, we only have to wait a little while longer."
  },
  {
   "i": 245,
   "start": 647.923,
   "end": 650.383,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "We'll say hello to Goku, and then we'll go home."
  },
  {
   "i": 246,
   "start": 650.383,
   "end": 652.483,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chiaotzu",
   "text": "Can we get McDonalds?"
  },
  {
   "i": 247,
   "start": 652.483,
   "end": 653.563,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Tien",
   "text": "Only if you're good."
  },
  {
   "i": 248,
   "start": 653.563,
   "end": 654.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Chiaotzu",
   "text": "Awww..."
  },
  {
   "i": 249,
   "start": 663.623,
   "end": 665.163,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "What? What are you lookin' at?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 250,
   "start": 665.163,
   "end": 666.723,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "What, do you like what you see?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 251,
   "start": 667.463,
   "end": 669.463,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Yeah, that's right, eyes to yourself."
  },
  {
   "i": 252,
   "start": 669.623,
   "end": 672.343,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I don't swing that way; I'm a real man!"
  },
  {
   "i": 253,
   "start": 672.843,
   "end": 674.423,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Hey, Mr Piccolo?"
  },
  {
   "i": 254,
   "start": 674.423,
   "end": 675.083,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Yeah?"
  },
  {
   "i": 255,
   "start": 675.163,
   "end": 679.703,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "I was wondering - why didn't you go with the rest of the Namekians to your home planet?"
  },
  {
   "i": 256,
   "start": 679.703,
   "end": 683.483,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Oh, I don't know; why don't you just go to Vegeta with the rest of the Saiyans?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 257,
   "start": 683.483,
   "end": 686.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Hey, I've already got one hitting on me over here, I don't need another!"
  },
  {
   "i": 258,
   "start": 686.583,
   "end": 688.043,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Beeping"
  },
  {
   "i": 259,
   "start": 688.043,
   "end": 689.003,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "'Oh, thank God.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 260,
   "start": 688.043,
   "end": 689.003,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Beeping"
  },
  {
   "i": 261,
   "start": 689.163,
   "end": 692.623,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Trunks",
   "text": "Alright, everybody - Goku should be landing any moment now."
  },
  {
   "i": 262,
   "start": 692.623,
   "end": 693.583,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "(Inhales)"
  },
  {
   "i": 263,
   "start": 694.583,
   "end": 696.923,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Well I don't see him, so you're wrong."
  },
  {
   "i": 264,
   "start": 697.023,
   "end": 699.243,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "I think you've been lying to us the whole time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 265,
   "start": 699.243,
   "end": 699.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "There's no way you could--"
  },
  {
   "i": 266,
   "start": 699.983,
   "end": 700.523,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "TCHING"
  },
  {
   "i": 267,
   "start": 699.983,
   "end": 700.523,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "There's no way you could--"
  },
  {
   "i": 268,
   "start": 700.523,
   "end": 701.803,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "WHOOSH"
  },
  {
   "i": 269,
   "start": 701.803,
   "end": 702.463,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "BOOM"
  },
  {
   "i": 270,
   "start": 705.043,
   "end": 706.343,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "...that could be anyone."
  },
  {
   "i": 271,
   "start": 721.143,
   "end": 722.983,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "GUYS, WE DON'T HAVE MUCH TIME! FREEZER'S HERE AND--"
  },
  {
   "i": 272,
   "start": 722.983,
   "end": 726.403,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Cheering"
  },
  {
   "i": 273,
   "start": 726.403,
   "end": 730.683,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Yaaaay... Heheheh... Wha...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 274,
   "start": 726.403,
   "end": 730.683,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Cheering"
  },
  {
   "i": 275,
   "start": 734.969,
   "end": 738.709,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "So... do you think the carpet matches the drapes?"
  },
  {
   "i": 276,
   "start": 738.709,
   "end": 739.949,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "I dunno. Do yours?"
  },
  {
   "i": 277,
   "start": 739.949,
   "end": 740.549,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "KRILLIN!"
  },
  {
   "i": 278,
   "start": 740.549,
   "end": 742.409,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "What? It was a leGINAmate question--!"
  },
  {
   "i": 279,
   "start": 742.409,
   "end": 744.589,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "I mean a legitimate ques-- whatever."
  },
  {
   "i": 280,
   "start": 744.589,
   "end": 747.089,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "It's just very personal! I mean, do *yours*?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 281,
   "start": 747.089,
   "end": 747.629,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "i": 282,
   "start": 748.069,
   "end": 748.669,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "What?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 283,
   "start": 748.669,
   "end": 750.089,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "It's called manscaping."
  },
  {
   "i": 284,
   "start": 750.089,
   "end": 750.789,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "It's weird."
  },
  {
   "i": 285,
   "start": 750.789,
   "end": 752.109,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Krillin",
   "text": "It's *hygenic*!"
  }
 ],
